  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together Greek yogurt, lemon juice, garlic, salt, and pepper.",
    "Add beef cubes to the marinade and mix well. Cover and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes.",
    "Thread beef, onion, bell pepper, zucchini, and mushroom onto skewers.",
    "Brush skewers with olive oil and season with salt and pepper.",
    "Grill skewers for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally, or until beef is cooked to desired level of doneness.",
    "Let skewers rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley and serve immediately."
